Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.98,Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Episode 48\N{\fs30}Executio
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jujutsu Kaisen. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.28,0:01:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birds chirp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.30,0:02:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.04,0:03:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.09,0:03:41.95,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&H0200E9&\3c&H010007&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.99,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&H0200E9&\3c&H010007&}The Culling Game
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what you're doing.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.51,0:03:55.22,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&H0200E9&\3c&H000000&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.48,0:04:22.65,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,650)\c&H2E2C2C&}JUJUTSU KAISEN\N{\fs12\c&HF3F3F3&\bord0\alpha&HFF&\t(237,736,1 \alpha&H00&)}The Culling Game Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I can't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.39,0:04:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not loving it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not loving it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me, love me, love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sound of this song. Loving,\Nlove me, I'm so Browning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me, turn me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the sound of this song. I\Nfeel like it's all right. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.82,0:04:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't change your mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, tell me, is Mai dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.04,0:05:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the clan head you\Nshould be concerned about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.56,0:05:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Maki's the one who's\Nnearly dead, not Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maki's a real beauty, but she's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can't support a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any woman who can't walk\Nhumbly behind her man
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deserves to be stabbed\Nin the back and killed.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.83,0:05:41.67,Main,Naoya,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mai-chan's a great woman in that regard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.58,0:05:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Mai's a great woman in that regard.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.19,0:05:43.82,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,310)\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\shad0\c&HCECDD1&}Special First-Grade Sorcerer    Naoya Zen'i
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.36,0:05:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has the same face and\Nthe same great rack as Maki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.92,0:05:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She may put on a brave face, but she\Nunderstands her place as a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where were you, and what\Nhave you been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.76,0:05:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father's in critical condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.82,0:06:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what difference does\Nit make if I'm here or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.06,0:06:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm going to be the\Nnext head of the Zenin clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All my older brothers are\Na bunch of knuckleheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Uncle, you're his little brother,\Nbut you haven't got what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your daughters are\Nout of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Jinichi, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't look the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.72,0:06:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had Toji's looks, it\Nwould be a different story.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.11,0:06:33.87,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,315)\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\shad0\c&HCECDD1&}Special First-Grade Sorcerer    Ogi Zen'i
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.87,0:06:38.08,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,315)\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\shad0\c&HCECDD1&}Special First-Grade Sorcerer    Jinichi Zen'i
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.96,0:06:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My father's dying, cut\Nme some slack, would you?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.37,0:06:38.09,Main,Naoya,0,0,0,,{\an8}Papa's in critical condition, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all a little on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see everyone's finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been informed that Naobito\NZenin, head of the Zenin clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has unfortunately taken his last breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Furudate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:07:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was entrusted by Naobito to read his\Nwill to you, his chosen family members,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.42,0:07:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,upon his passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogi Zenin, Jinichi Zenin, and Naoya Zenin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you are all gathered here today,\NI shall begin the reading immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.14,0:07:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless, of course, any of you\Nhave an objection to my doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First item, Naoya Zenin shall be\Nmade the 27th head of the Zenin Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.94,0:07:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second item,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naoya shall inherit all assets and\Ncursed tools that are currently
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stored in either Jujutsu High or\Nthe Zenin Clan's Forbidden Vaults.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In addition to that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.10,0:07:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naoya shall require\Nagreement from either Ogi or
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinichi Zenin before\Nmaking use of any contents.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.42,0:07:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, in the event that\NSatoru Gojo dies before I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or otherwise loses the use\Nof his mental faculties,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.40,0:08:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then the covenant with Toji\NFushiguro shall be fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megumi Fushiguro will be\Nwelcomed into the Zenin clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that same person will become the new
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,head of the Zenin clan\Nand inherit its assets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh what the hell those guys have\Nno balls they think some unknown
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brat is ahead would be better than\Nme so they ain't doing jack about it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where's megumi and what is he doing\Nnow i don't know much only that he's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on a mission to find yuji itadori\Nsomewhere in the tokyo and who's that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he is the vessel of sukuna then go\Ntell the big shots that naoya zenin is
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going to kill sukuna's vessel and since\Nmegumi is with sukuna's vessel i'll
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.12,0:09:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kill them both together tokyo is in\Npandemonium right now people can die
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.38,0:09:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any time for any reason there. Once I\Nkill him, the rest will work itself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.14,0:09:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the zenin clan belongs to me
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.17,0:09:24.42,Flashback,Yuji,0,0,0,,{\an8}Only me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,itadori
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.16,0:09:26.11,Flashback,Kugisaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,itadori itadori What will you be doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.14,0:09:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuji, how are your injuries?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.94,0:10:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, except for where I took that\Nblack flash, but I'm healing fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.86,0:10:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably because of Sukuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel how his power\Nhas grown stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuji, don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go back to Jujutsu High.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.34,0:10:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to retrieve the\Nremains of Choso and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.26,0:10:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.66,0:10:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not an issue of me\Nwanting to return or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sukuna's plotting something\Nthat uses Fushiguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, I've killed so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.44,0:10:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you going to feel when someone you\Nsave goes on to kill someone else later?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can stay\Nwith the others anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you feel, Choso?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.44,0:10:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I killed your\Nlittle brothers, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Esau and Kechizu would have done the\Nsame if they were in my position.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.86,0:10:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgiving you or not doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.28,0:10:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to be siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.32,0:11:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.23,0:11:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to reduce the\Nnumber of cursed spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.14,0:11:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.58,0:12:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.72,0:12:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.94,0:13:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already sensed he was\Npowerful when he fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.36,0:13:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he's added subtlety to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is unfaltering control\Nof his cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.98,0:13:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An exceptional physical strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's truly like a war god.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crazy that he wasn't\Nin top shape until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.38,0:13:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're very impressive, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have to keep saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As often as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.82,0:13:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, he should have been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.74,0:13:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father should have also had stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.36,0:13:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With his forehead, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me Megumi's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.72,0:14:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I the first to arrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.38,0:14:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.60,0:14:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's way too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.74,0:14:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.04,0:14:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he looking for Fushiguro?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.20,0:14:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't exactly blend in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.60,0:14:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Planning an escape? Escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.80,0:14:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been sentenced to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you no longer\Nhave Satoru's protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are lots of sorcerers who have\Nbeen saved due to Gojo's influence,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pride, and wimps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.14,0:14:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My business is with Megumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So to be blunt, I couldn't\Ncare less if you live or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.78,0:14:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.82,0:14:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you running\Naround willy-nilly,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.98,0:14:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm going to break your legs for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.28,0:14:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want Fushiguro for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.16,0:14:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need him to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.46,0:14:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it'd be great if he could\Nsign some papers before he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I heard he's looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.42,0:15:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's certainly faster than us,\Nbut something is off. Probably
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.42,0:15:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his technique you're doing\Nbetter than i expected i honestly
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,underestimated you i know the\Nvessel's got stuff going on but what's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that thing beside him i guess\Ni'll crank up the speed a bit more
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I feeling Gojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no it's even creepier three of\Nyou i thought you'd be alone
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.14,0:15:58.93,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(950,0)\3c&HB0C0B3&\c&H1D201B&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.52,0:16:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who is that whoever he is it's bad\NWhat are your relationships to Itadori?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's also here to execute Yuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your name is Okkotsu, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okkotsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.05,0:16:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The second year Fushiguro talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A special great sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.24,0:16:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.76,0:16:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.70,0:16:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Naoya Zenin, you know, Maki's cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.02,0:16:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm here to kill\NItadori, just like you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuji, we have to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stay out of your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.32,0:16:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde one's fast\Nwith some kind of trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.68,0:16:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to avoid getting into a\Nchase. I'll stall him. Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in return for staying out of\Nyour way after you kill Itadori,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe you could hold off\Na bit before reporting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.26,0:16:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to use him as bait for\Nsomeone else. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.22,0:17:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one they've\Ncome here for, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.30,0:17:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okkotsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.21,0:17:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just worry about getting away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.30,0:17:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems like the same type as Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.58,0:17:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll die if you fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have kept quiet about Megumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.02,0:17:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me and my big mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.94,0:17:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My plan keeps Yuji from\Nfighting another human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.02,0:17:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And prevents him from\Nfeeling guilty toward me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.74,0:17:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's such a handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.50,0:17:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meet up at yesterday's spot, Yuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.84,0:17:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave that one to you, then. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.90,0:17:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with that sword drawn, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's pretty quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.84,0:17:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd planned to crush him\Nwhen he broke into a run.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was trying to block Akutsu's\Npath, but you read my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was watching you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.72,0:17:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's blood manipulation, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only I can't figure out why you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.76,0:17:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, it's not that scary\Naside from piercing blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And producing piercing\Nblood takes convergence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:17:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a long build-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's\Nanything left to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.85,0:18:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.36,0:18:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think you could go after my little\Nbrother and then leave this place alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.52,0:18:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I was able to cut him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.56,0:18:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's like Maki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:18:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.63,0:19:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't seem like the power type, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.50,0:19:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with uproar power, he has an\Ninsane amount of Cursed Energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually am on the weaker side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's enhancing himself with Cursed\NEnergy to cover for his lack of strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.70,0:19:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone does that to some\Ndegree, but when he does it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's the exact opposite of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.50,0:19:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.96,0:19:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have more Cursed Energy\Nthan your teacher, Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, Gojo has his six eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.74,0:19:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he wastes practically no energy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.58,0:19:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he activates his techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the best there is when\Nit comes to performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.96,0:19:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike your teacher, I can\Nrun out of cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough chit-chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the better the sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.20,0:19:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the harder it is to read the\Nflow of their cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.32,0:19:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yours will be hard to read as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.16,0:19:59.66,Sign_Basic,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord2\shad0\pos(332,158)\c&H5D3842&\3c&HF7C6E6&}Third-rate
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.17,0:19:57.76,Italics,Yuji,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's because the better a sorcerer is,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.17,0:19:59.67,Sign_Basic,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,315)\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\shad0}When a sorcerer is inexperienced with manipulating cursed energy, there's a deviation in the \Ncursed energy during their preliminary movements, allowing the prediction of their next action.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.42,0:19:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because the better the sorcerer,\Nthe more precise their cursed energy.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.76,0:19:59.68,Italics,Yuji,0,0,0,,{\an8}the more precisely they \Nmanipulate cursed energy.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.67,0:20:02.92,Sign_Basic,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,315)\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\shad0}When they have mastered manipulating cursed energy, there is no such deviation in their cursed energy, making it difficult to predict their action until the last second.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.67,0:20:02.92,Sign_Basic,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord2\shad0\c&H160F10&\3c&HE6AF21&\pos(313.333,171.333)}First-rate
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.89,0:20:02.92,Italics,Yuji,0,0,0,,{\an8}That means you can't predict \Ntheir attack until the last second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.00,0:20:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means you can't predict their\Nattack until the last second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But with this guy, there's\Ncursed energy constantly rising?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from his entire body, even his sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.92,0:20:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not even a question\Nof reading his moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can land decisive flows\Nwith all his attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he can reduce all\Ndamage to the bare minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.74,0:20:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Okkotsu, but I\Ncan't afford to die yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.62,0:20:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are some types who centered their\Ntraining around the use of a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you don't want to become\Ndependent on a cursed tool
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.40,0:20:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then neglect your\Nmanipulation of cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.82,0:20:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Slaughter Demon is\Njust an emergency measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.56,0:20:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've never taught me this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're putting too much\Nfocus into the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.60,0:21:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It broke?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.18,0:21:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.52,0:21:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's one of Gojo's students.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.58,0:21:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're not going down easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.30,0:21:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wound's deep, but none\Nof my organs are falling out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.24,0:21:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now we're both unarmed. I can win!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.10,0:21:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're playing, Rika. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rika?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.24,0:21:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Shikigami?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold him still.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.56,0:21:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.12,0:21:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:22:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.32,0:22:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.72,0:22:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.56,0:22:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.32,0:23:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Older brothers less competent than\Nyounger brothers serve no purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.18,0:23:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't understand how you\Nnever loved your brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.74,0:23:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please report Itadori's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.16,0:23:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when all the distortion started.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.00,0:23:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.38,0:23:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start by saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.58,0:23:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Checkmate.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.99,0:23:55.06,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Next Episode\N{\fs30}One More Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.74,0:23:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sumiki has been drawn into this game too.

